{"id":"11a305a5b8299748","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-color-class-size.md","title":"颜色等价类大小","display":"df-color-class-size — 颜色等价类大小","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-color-class-size","aliases":["29-df-color-class-size"],"display":"df-color-class-size — 颜色等价类大小","depends_on":["[[29-df-colored-graph]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.8, p.184, DjVu scan 199","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-color-class-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-color-class-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-color-class-size — 颜色等价类大小"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.8, p.184, DjVu scan 199"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\geq0\">\\(r\\geq0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Col}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Col}_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a>。</li>\n<li>论域非空且有限，故下式最大值存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v),\\qquad u,v\\in|G|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v),\\qquad u,v\\in|G|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G\\coloneqq\\{u\\in|G|\\mid u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{v\\in|G|}|[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G\\coloneqq\\{u\\in|G|\\mid u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{v\\in|G|}|[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{r,\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\leq k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_{r,\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\leq k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.8，印刷页 184，扫描页 199。书中“color-class size k”表示没有超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个顶点具有相同全部颜色，实为上界而非最大值必须等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>；本条显式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq k\">\\(\\leq k\\)</span> 避免误读。颜色相同是所有一元谓词真值相同，允许颜色重叠。此定义不包含原书 Proposition 12.9 的三变量刻画结论，后者需单独证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\geq0$，$G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$，$k\\geq1$；$\\operatorname{Col}_G$ 见 [[29-df-colored-graph]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Col}_G","display":false},{"tex":"u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v),\\qquad u,v\\in|G|.","display":true},{"tex":"[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G\\coloneqq\\{u\\in|G|\\mid u\\sim_G^{\\mathrm{col}}v\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{v\\in|G|}|[v]^{\\mathrm{col}}_G|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{r,\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\mid\\operatorname{ccs}(G)\\leq k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq k","display":false}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]、[[29-df-color-class-size]]、[[29-df-graph-canonization]] — 彩色图、色类上界与规范化"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-color-class-size]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-color-class-size|29-df-color-class-size]]"}],"outgoing":["dd6d5729a326908a"]}